OL,3,GNEWSAHow does Amber Army feel about new
OL,4,Astadium talks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge United has begun looking at a
OL,7,Fpotential move away from its Abbey
OL,8,FStadium as part of long-term plans to
OL,9,Fexpand and develop the city.
OL,11,FThe idea is in its very early stages,
OL,12,Fwith a study looking into whether land
OL,13,Fabout a mile away could host a
OL,14,F15,000-capacity stadium.
OL,16,FAny move, if it goes ahead, is not
OL,17,Fexpected for several years.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
